(iii) The applicant shall not commit an offence similar to the offence of which he is accused;
(iv). The applicant shall not seek unnecessary adjournments during the trial;
(v) The applicant shall not leave India without previous permission of the trial Court/Investigating Officer, as the case may be;
(vi) The applicant and complainant shall cooperate in the exercise and due intimation be given to the parties before undertaking such exercise;
(vii) The applicant shall mark his presence on every Sunday before the concerned police station between 10:00 am to 2:00 pm till filing of charge-sheet.
Note:- SDO and Tehsildar Hujur, District Bhopal are expected to undertake demarcation proceedings of complainant of Khasra No.14/4/2 admeasuring 1.82 acres, Village Bhaisakhedi,
Ward No.3 Tehsil Hujur, District Bhopal within 15 days' so that land of complainant may not be compromised and allegations of complainant may be verified from the revenue records.
List the case on 10.05.2023 for further orders.

